        "subject": "={{ 'Quick question re: ' + $('Loop Over Items').item.json.Company + ' website & growth' }}",
        "message": "={{ '<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#2d3748;line-height:1.6;\"><p>Hi ' + ($('Loop Over Items').item.json['Lead Name'] || 'there') + ',</p><p>I wanted to follow up briefly on my previous note regarding <strong>' + ($('Loop Over Items').item.json.Company || 'your company') + '</strong>\\'s online presence.</p><p>I took another look at your site and spotted 2 specific opportunities to improve mobile loading speed and conversion flow to capture more qualified inquiries.</p><p>Would you be open to a 3-minute video walkthrough where I share a few actionable design ideas we\\'ve used to lift conversions for similar brands?</p><p>Best regards,<br><strong>Alex Morgan</strong><br>Apex Design & Growth Studio</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:20px;\">P.S. If you prefer not to receive follow-ups, reply \"stop\" and I will remove you right away.</p></div>' }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
