        "message": "={{ '<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#2d3748;line-height:1.6;\"><p>Hi ' + ($('Loop Over Items').item.json['Lead Name'] || 'there') + ',</p><p>I know you are likely busy at <strong>' + ($('Loop Over Items').item.json.Company || 'your company') + '</strong>, so I will keep this short.</p><p>We recently redesigned the service pages and booking funnel for a similar client in your space, which led to a <strong>41% increase in high-intent demo requests</strong> without increasing their ad spend.</p><p>Would you be opposed to a quick 10-minute screenshare this Thursday or Friday to take a look at the teardown?</p><p>Warm regards,<br><strong>Alex Morgan</strong><br>Apex Design & Growth Studio</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:20px;\">P.S. Reply \"stop\" to opt out.</p></div>' }}",
